.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]` and `v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]`\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia 15.6.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee MRP below, but there's very little to the scene, so I'll copy/paste it here:\n\n- Scene hierarchy: `PanelContainer` with a `RichTextLabel` under it\n- The `RichTextLabel` has `fit_content = true`, `clip_contents = false`, and this text:\n\n```bb\n[table=1]\n[cell padding=2,2,2,2][center](Damage reduction)[/center][/cell]\n[cell padding=2,2,2,2][center]0%[/center][/cell]\n[cell padding=2,2,2,2 bg=darkgreen][center]5%[/center][/cell]\n[cell padding=2,2,2,2][center]10%[/center][/cell]\n[/table]\n```\n\n<img width=\"355\" height=\"407\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd1ba406-1f84-4d9e-a0df-7c46b5fad699\" />\n\nOther notes:\n\n- Increasing the size of the `PanelContainer` will work.\n- Setting `clip_contents = true` will fix the background color but can cause the header text to get clipped (this is less obvious in the minimal repro, but it happens with \"real\" tables with more columns and values)\n- As a workaround, if I get rid of the left and right `padding` values and instead use a `MarginContainer`, it looks better.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[TableHighlightRepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25053226/TableHighlightRepro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://a